= Annastasia von Yoaken

Annastasia is one of the founders of our party and is widely respected for her work on writing the constitution however some of her critics accuse her of building a cult of personality and a machiavellian like persona.
  
- @support_peoples_party
- @build_peoples_party
- @campaigning_peoples_party
